 "remarks": "Freshly remodeled 3 bedroom apartment in one of the most conveniently located neighborhoods in town. You will be able to walk to the beach, train, Veterans Park (waterfront), pharmacy, deli, restaurants, shopping and more within minutes. Hop in your car for all Norwalk has to offer including nightlife and restaurants in SONO, the stunning new mall, hiking & frisbee golf at Cranbury Park, Stew Leonard's, the Maritime Aquarium, Stepping Stones Museum for Kids, and so much more. Need to get to work? You are one minute to the train station and I-95. I'm sure you know how hot the rental market is right now, grab this one before it's gone. Owner related to agent.",
